  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 Resolve or 1 source of fresh blood</p><p><strong>Range:</strong> Self</p><p>You gorge yourself on the blood of your foes.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, whenever you inflict <strong>Damage</strong> to a living creature with blood, you regain <strong>Stamina</strong> equal to half the <strong>Damage</strong> dealt (minimum of <strong>1</strong>).</p><p>If you <strong>Damage</strong> a swarm, you recover <strong>Stamina</strong> equal to the <strong>Damage</strong> dealt.</p><p>You may spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> or <strong>1 source of fresh blood</strong> at the start of your turn to sustain this effect.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.siAyYgUyyZdLVh0u]{Blood Feast}</p>",
